   "scene_type": "data_flow",
   "duration_hint": 13,
   "spoken": "Microsoft calls it enterprise data protection. For Copilot on business plans, your prompts and responses get the same contractual commitments as your emails in Exchange and your files in SharePoint, under the data protection addendum and product terms.",
